WEBVTT

00:04:56.800 --> 00:05:00.054
for me to pee.

00:05:00.054 --> 00:05:01.947
I was a child,

00:05:01.947 --> 00:05:04.572
too young to understand the circumstances

00:05:04.572 --> 00:05:07.003
of my being there.

00:05:07.003 --> 00:05:11.769
Children are amazingly adaptable.

00:05:11.769 --> 00:05:15.326
What would be grotesquely abnormal

00:05:15.326 --> 00:05:18.180
became my normality

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:21.794
in the prisoner of war camps.

00:05:21.794 --> 00:05:25.484
It became routine for me to line up three times a day

00:05:25.484 --> 00:05:30.231
to eat lousy food in a noisy mess hall.